<Base title="Start here">
  <h1>Start here</h1>
  <p>Hi! I'm Toby 👋</p>
  <p>I help innovative tech companies make smarter product decisions.</p>
  <p>I'm passionate about product, strategy, creativity and innovation, and love trying to figure out how to solve complicated customer problems.</p>

  <h2>Career</h2>
  <p>I'm Head of Product at <a href="https://hedgehoglab.com/">hedgehog lab</a> where I help our clients turn their product vision into reality. Previously, I was Head of Product at <a href="https://mypebble.co.uk/">Pebble</a>, where I managed a portfolio of financial management products for schools. Before then, I was part of the founding team at <a href="https://eduprise.co.uk">Eduprise</a> where I led the development of the company's industry-leading marketing and communications software and services as Head of Strategy.</p>
  <p>I got my first taste of product management as a Business Analyst on <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Npower_(United_Kingdom)">npower</a>'s £500m SAP implementation where I quickly learned everything that's wrong with Waterfall software development.</p>
  <p>I'm a non-technical product manager with a background in media and education.</p>

  <h2>About me</h2>
  <p>I used to be a professional music journalist until I realised I couldn't pay the mortgage with free CDs and guestlist passes. I've written for high profile publications on both sides of the Atlantic including <a href="https://www.nme.com/">NME</a>, <a href="https://www.dazeddigital.com/">Dazed &amp; Confused</a>, <a href="https://www.pastemagazine.com/">Paste</a>, and <a href="https://ghettoblastermagazine.com/">Ghettoblaster</a> (among others).</p>
  <p>I was identified as having ADHD as a child, but have never had an adult diagnosis. I've still got plenty of the traits, though, and have spent a lot of time building my own productivity frameworks to help me stay focused. I'm currently using a mashup of David Allen's <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/1633.Getting_Things_Done">Getting Things Done</a>, Tiago Forte's <a href="https://fortelabs.co/blog/para/">PARA method</a>, and J.D. Meier's <a href="https://gettingresults.com/">Agile Results</a>.</p>
  <p>I'm a lifelong cult movie nerd, and am trying to build a definitive collection of Italian Giallos and Poliziotteschi. I'm an avid record collector and have an awesome collection of garage rock, psychedelia, punk, and indie on vinyl.</p>
  <p>I'm rapidly hurtling towards middle age but still stand at the front at gigs. I won't turn into the bald fat man in the red BMW convertible.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Follow me on <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/tobyrogers.pm">Bluesky</a> or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tobiasrogers">LinkedIn</a> &ndash; <em>my DMs are always open</em>.</p>
</Base>
